From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:54:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mix.json: the ground sound thread's land block of 20:54Z
 (five silent clip cues for the bazooka team and the loader's carbine)

land.bodyCues bazooka_fire, rocket_loaded, wire_contact, helmet_tap and
rifle_shot, each null with a note, so no clip cue asks for a missing take.
No sound changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01L4rhz35oCkUv94Xb2EwCjp
---
 unreal/TheaterCommand/Content/Data/Sound/mix.json | 14 ++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/unreal/TheaterCommand/Content/Data/Sound/mix.json b/unreal/TheaterCommand/Content/Data/Sound/mix.json
index ea5b3cb9..71304c95 100644
--- a/unreal/TheaterCommand/Content/Data/Sound/mix.json
